      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ten_Sleep%2C_Wyoming"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Annual local traditions include a fourth of July rodeo and parade, as well as a music festival called NoWoodStock in August.",
